[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2730595162","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104215#issuecomment-2730595162","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104215","id":2730595162,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iwZNa","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-17T19:21:24Z","updated_at":"2025-03-17T19:22:43Z","body":"This is technically not a bug. This is a consequence of box selection requiring framing the *whole* AABB to work. This could be fixed by making box selection only require touching a small part of the AABB to work, but this will also make it much more aggressive.\n\nThere is no ideal solution here: sometimes, box selection is best done in a conservative manner, but sometimes it's best to have it more aggressive. Most apps out there seem to use aggressive box selection by default (including OS file managers). Some apps allow you to control this with a modifier such as <kbd>Shift</kbd>, where the default behavior is to be aggressive and holding <kbd>Shift</kbd> makes it conservative instead (li